E. Beurling-Selberg minorant and real-factor recombination roles
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Beurling-Selberg role: one-sided bandlimited certificate with defect labels:
  bandlimit, low Fourier coefficients, one-sided error, tail budget.
arXiv:2410.15880 role: recombine real linear/quadratic packets by subset sum.
degree | naive subsets | meet-in-middle proxy | Horowitz-Sahni paper proxy
    20 |       1048576 |                 1024 |                          32
    40 | 1099511627776 |              1048576 |                        1024
    80 | 1208925819614629174706176 |        1099511627776 |                     1048576
   100 | 1267650600228229401496703205376 |     1125899906842624 |                    33554432
Readout: recombination is useful only with packet labels; otherwise it is
another lossy product/factor analogy.

